{"unit_id":"tag:06KU:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上光滑（smooth）的函子中的群胚（groupoid in functors）。假设<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>是形变函子（deformation functors）。则：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>商（quotient）<MATH_0005>是形变范畴（deformation category）。\n<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0006>的切空间（tangent space）为\n<MATH_0007>\n<STRUCT_0004><MATH_0008>的无穷小自同构（infinitesimal automorphisms）空间为\n<MATH_0009>\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚"},{"source_term":"deformation functors","target_term":"形变函子"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"deformation category","target_term":"形变范畴"},{"source_term":"tangent space","target_term":"切空间"},{"source_term":"infinitesimal automorphisms","target_term":"无穷小自同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"空词表；光滑性暂定。"},{"source_term":"groupoid in functors","target_term":"函子中的群胚","context":"空词表；函子中的群胚暂定。"},{"source_term":"deformation functors","target_term":"形变函子","context":"空词表；形变函子暂定。"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"空词表；商暂定。"},{"source_term":"deformation category","target_term":"形变范畴","context":"空词表；形变范畴暂定。"},{"source_term":"tangent space","target_term":"切空间","context":"空词表；切空间暂定。"},{"source_term":"infinitesimal automorphisms","target_term":"无穷小自同构","context":"空词表；无穷小自同构暂定。"}],"notes":[]}
